@startuml
title EIMS Log Investigation & Evidence Review — reconstructed as-built use cases
left to right direction
actor "Infrastructure engineer" as Engineer
rectangle "Integrated EIMS Analyzer" {
  usecase "Submit text, file or\nevidence bundle" as Submit
  usecase "Review source, observed\nevidence and uncertainty" as Review
  usecase "Inspect original file\nand line references" as Evidence
  usecase "Find diagnostic\nknowledge references" as Catalog
  usecase "Retrieve saved\ninvestigation history" as History
  usecase "Export displayed\ninvestigation result" as Export
  usecase "Ask contextual\nfollow-up question" as Followup
}
Engineer --> Submit
Engineer --> Review
Engineer --> Evidence
Engineer --> Catalog
Engineer --> History
Engineer --> Export
Engineer --> Followup
note bottom of Submit
  Existing source behavior; operational authorization
  depends on configured auth mode. USB collection
  is a separate supporting workflow.
end note
@enduml
